			"notes": "# Update Notes - First Update of 2024\n\nThis update marks the first update of 2024, but it might also be the last one for a few months, as the author needs to prepare for the college entrance examination =.= \n\n## Highlights:\n- Added wand crafting recipes\n- Introduced crystal pendants\n- Fixed the issue of magic plants spawning randomly for decorative purposes only\n\nAt this stage, I still wouldn't highly recommend playing this mod in survival mode.\nChinese:\n# 2024年的第一次更新\n\n这是2024年的第一次更新但也可能是近几个月的最后一次更新，原因是我要备战高考 =.= \n\n## 主要内容:\n- 添加了法杖的合成\n- 添加了原aic中诺艾儿家很常见的水晶吊坠灯（以及它的合成配方）\n- 修复了魔法植物无限制生长问题（它在现阶段不应该生成）\n\n在现阶段，我仍不推荐将此模组在生存模式下游玩"
